WEBVTT

00:13.513 --> 00:16.766
This court finds the defendant,
Jolyne Cujoh…

00:16.850 --> 00:18.601
You're an interesting one.

00:19.102 --> 00:21.479
So what did you do?
Why did you get thrown in?

00:22.063 --> 00:22.981
I'm innocent.

00:23.648 --> 00:28.737
…shall be confined to
Green Dolphin Street State Prison

00:28.820 --> 00:30.780
for 15 years.

00:30.864 --> 00:33.324
What is this?

00:33.950 --> 00:36.578
Turns out you have an ability.

00:37.078 --> 00:38.747
"Stone Ocean."

00:38.830 --> 00:42.959
I'll become free
from this ocean of stones.

02:13.716 --> 02:14.676
EPISODE 3: THE VISITOR (1)

02:14.759 --> 02:15.969
Stone Ocean.

02:16.052 --> 02:19.556
When unraveled, this thread can reach far.

02:19.639 --> 02:22.684
However, it becomes less powerful
and inflicts less damage.

02:24.644 --> 02:26.396
When it bundles, it hardens.

02:27.188 --> 02:30.191
Its reach is reduced to about two meters.

02:31.943 --> 02:34.529
Can I break through the bars
with Stone Ocean?

02:35.113 --> 02:37.490
No, it lacked the strength to do so.

02:37.574 --> 02:39.325
The most it could do was this.

02:43.288 --> 02:46.416
My mental energy is harnessed
using the stone inside the charm.

02:47.292 --> 02:49.502
I'd like to get out of here
using this power,

02:51.546 --> 02:53.089
but now's not the time yet.

02:53.673 --> 02:54.883
First, I need to learn

02:55.884 --> 02:57.260
all I can about this place.

02:57.760 --> 02:59.345
Hey, you.

02:59.929 --> 03:01.598
I'm talking to you!

03:01.681 --> 03:04.475
Sorry, but can you lend me some change?

03:04.559 --> 03:08.062
I've got some in my room,
but the call is about to disconnect.

03:08.146 --> 03:12.025
I can pay you back as soon as I'm done.
A dollar is all I need.

03:12.609 --> 03:14.903
I haven't spoken to my family in a while.

03:16.404 --> 03:17.280
Sure.

03:18.114 --> 03:18.948
Here.

03:19.032 --> 03:22.160
Thanks! You saved my skin!
I'll pay you back for sure!

03:24.746 --> 03:28.875
Move, bitch! Don't try to cut in line!

03:28.958 --> 03:30.210
Hold on!

03:30.293 --> 03:34.714
I was waiting for her
to finish for 30 minutes!

03:34.797 --> 03:36.633
I didn't see you waiting in line!

03:36.716 --> 03:38.676
Dumbass, you must be new.

03:38.760 --> 03:41.095
You've got to reserve
these phones in advance.

03:41.179 --> 03:42.680
No one told me that!

03:42.764 --> 03:44.599
Well, now you know.

03:44.682 --> 03:47.477
Also, the reservations
are made a month in advance.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.229
A month?

03:49.312 --> 03:53.775
Why should I wait a whole month
for a few minutes of phone time?

03:53.858 --> 03:56.319
That's what's strange
about prison, isn't it?

03:56.402 --> 03:58.947
Hey, I'll buy that spot
on the phone from you.

04:00.323 --> 04:03.201
And this is the cause of the phenomenon.

04:06.913 --> 04:08.331
Hey, Mom!

04:09.457 --> 04:12.126
I want to call her.
I need to hear her voice.

04:12.210 --> 04:13.336
The voice of my mom…

04:13.419 --> 04:15.171
Jolyne!

04:15.255 --> 04:17.048
How do you fare?

04:17.131 --> 04:19.217
Shut your trap! Keep away from me!

04:19.300 --> 04:21.886
I already told you I'm through with you!

04:21.970 --> 04:25.098
Don't push me away like that.

04:25.181 --> 04:26.683
I'm giving you a warning.

04:26.766 --> 04:29.978
You messed up big time just now.

04:30.061 --> 04:30.979
What?

04:31.062 --> 04:33.606
You just lent a dollar
to that blondie, right?

04:34.399 --> 04:36.567
Get her to pay you back right now.

04:36.651 --> 04:39.946
No, your life here will be over
if you don't get it back now.

04:40.029 --> 04:43.157
What are you saying?
Of course, she'll pay me back.

04:43.241 --> 04:44.617
It was just a dollar.

04:44.701 --> 04:47.954
Hey, you said "just a dollar"!

04:48.037 --> 04:51.291
You're digging your own grave
with that mentality!

04:51.374 --> 04:52.208
What?

04:52.292 --> 04:54.335
Listen closely, Jolyne.

04:54.419 --> 04:56.004
At the Aquarium,

04:56.087 --> 04:59.173
lending or borrowing money between inmates

04:59.257 --> 05:01.884
is one thing
you should avoid at all costs.

05:01.968 --> 05:03.386
Even if it's just a dollar.

05:03.469 --> 05:08.391
Let's say that you fail
to get the dollar back.

05:08.474 --> 05:09.851
You know what will happen?

05:11.185 --> 05:12.770
You'll become a bottom feeder like her.

05:16.232 --> 05:21.362
"Jolyne the newbie
couldn't even extort back her dollar."

05:21.446 --> 05:23.906
The rumor will spread like wildfire

05:24.407 --> 05:26.284
and you'll be the target in no time.

05:26.367 --> 05:27.327
Just like her.

05:27.410 --> 05:30.413
One after another, every single day.

05:30.496 --> 05:34.292
Once you're out of money, you'll be forced
to give your body and even your mind.

05:34.375 --> 05:37.670
Isn't that what hell on earth is like?

05:37.754 --> 05:39.922
Hey, now. You're exaggerating.

05:40.006 --> 05:43.926
Am I, now? It was
"just a dollar" for her at first.

05:44.010 --> 05:46.137
See that blonde from earlier?

05:46.721 --> 05:47.805
She went to her room,

05:47.889 --> 05:50.391
but she's not planning on
coming down for you.

05:50.475 --> 05:53.936
I'm telling you for your own sake.

06:06.574 --> 06:07.784
Got a minute?

06:07.867 --> 06:09.869
Oh, hello there.

06:09.952 --> 06:11.913
Apparently, this one's a classic.

06:11.996 --> 06:13.039
Have you read it?

06:13.623 --> 06:14.499
No.

06:15.083 --> 06:16.918
I'm here for the money.

06:17.001 --> 06:20.463
Are you ready to pay me back?

06:20.546 --> 06:22.131
Oh, of course.

06:22.715 --> 06:24.759
A dollar, right? I haven't forgotten.

06:24.842 --> 06:28.054
It's all in my head, don't worry about it.

06:28.638 --> 06:29.972
I'll pay you back later.

06:30.056 --> 06:32.517
You said you have the money in your room.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.894
You went back, right?
Do you have it now?

06:34.977 --> 06:37.563
Shut up, you bitch!

06:37.647 --> 06:41.484
I said I'll give it back later.
I don't have it now, you hear me?

06:41.567 --> 06:43.611
You a tightwad or what?

06:47.115 --> 06:51.077
Anyway, can you lend me ten more?

06:51.160 --> 06:55.998
I can call up friends on the outside
and ask for more money!

06:56.082 --> 06:59.168
Please? You've got to have some on you.
Come on, don't be shy!

07:22.400 --> 07:23.568
What's this…

07:29.157 --> 07:30.533
What the heck is this?

07:30.616 --> 07:32.160
I can't hold it in!

07:34.162 --> 07:36.330
Hey, you in there!

07:36.914 --> 07:38.916
Can you hurry it up?

07:39.500 --> 07:41.627
I know you're in there!

07:41.711 --> 07:45.173
I'll give you the dollar!

07:45.256 --> 07:48.217
-Please!
-You'll pay me later, right?

07:48.301 --> 07:51.220
Don't worry about it. Take your time.

07:52.597 --> 07:56.184
I'll buy the time from you!
I'll pay five… No, ten dollars!

07:56.267 --> 07:57.101
Sold!

07:58.019 --> 08:01.147
Sorry. That'll be ten dollars.

08:13.367 --> 08:14.327
Hey, you.

08:14.952 --> 08:16.496
Go use the bathroom next.

08:16.579 --> 08:19.123
Someone else will have
the urge to use it soon.

08:19.707 --> 08:23.586
It's up to you whether you can get
your money back, though.

08:24.170 --> 08:27.590
You're the only one who can save yourself.

08:30.593 --> 08:33.179
What the… What's going on?

08:33.262 --> 08:36.182
That's right, I'll be leaving soon.

08:36.265 --> 08:37.642
Somehow, I'll get out.

08:40.770 --> 08:43.481
Inmate number FE40536.

08:43.981 --> 08:45.483
I'm returning to my cell.

08:45.566 --> 08:47.026
Please unlock this door.

09:06.212 --> 09:07.213
Tomorrow at noon,

09:08.297 --> 09:10.091
you will have a visitor.

09:10.675 --> 09:12.009
But you must not meet him.

09:12.677 --> 09:15.346
You must not go to the visitation room.

09:15.930 --> 09:16.847
If you do,

09:17.473 --> 09:19.308
you and others will be in grave danger.

09:19.892 --> 09:22.395
A fate more terrible than death
will happen.

09:32.321 --> 09:34.532
Who was that just now?

09:34.615 --> 09:36.367
How did a child sneak in here?

09:36.450 --> 09:37.660
Hey you!

09:38.160 --> 09:40.705
Didn't you hear my order to standby?

09:40.788 --> 09:42.707
Do not touch the bars!

09:42.790 --> 09:43.791
Stand back!

09:43.874 --> 09:44.792
Open the door.

09:44.875 --> 09:45.751
Right now!

09:46.460 --> 09:48.796
I said do not grab the bars!

10:36.844 --> 10:39.764
A visitor is coming tomorrow at noon.

10:39.847 --> 10:41.474
Not to see you, though,

10:41.557 --> 10:44.101
but someone in the next building,
you know what I mean?

10:44.185 --> 10:45.394
That's the intel.

10:50.775 --> 10:51.776
Oh, by the way,

10:52.985 --> 10:54.570
you got it on backwards.

10:54.654 --> 10:55.946
Your pants, I mean.

11:10.169 --> 11:11.379
You're overreacting.

11:11.462 --> 11:14.715
Sorry about yesterday, FE40536.

11:14.799 --> 11:18.678
But it's your fault
for grabbing onto the bars like that.

11:18.761 --> 11:20.346
Rules are rules.

11:20.429 --> 11:22.181
I had already let go.

11:22.264 --> 11:24.141
But you still hit me twice.

11:24.225 --> 11:28.145
What? Did you mutter something?
Couldn't hear you.

11:28.229 --> 11:31.065
Never mind. How can I help you?

11:31.148 --> 11:32.900
Someone's here to see you.

11:35.027 --> 11:37.363
Stand up. I'll handcuff you.

11:37.446 --> 11:41.075
A visitor? Who is it, my mom?

11:41.158 --> 11:43.786
How the hell should I know?
Give me your hands.

11:52.169 --> 11:54.213
Stand on the mark right there.

11:55.339 --> 11:56.632
I'll explain the rules.

11:56.716 --> 12:00.720
You have 30 minutes.
You are allowed to hold hands,

12:00.803 --> 12:03.222
but kissing or undressing are not allowed.

12:03.305 --> 12:06.183
You will receive anything
they bring after the visitation.

12:06.267 --> 12:07.893
Foreign languages are forbidden.

12:07.977 --> 12:11.230
Depending on the visit,
the guard may choose to end it.

12:11.731 --> 12:14.024
Wait there until you're authorized.

12:24.535 --> 12:25.911
You mustn't go any further.

12:29.373 --> 12:31.500
Turn around. Go back to your room!

12:32.293 --> 12:33.627
It's not too late!

12:33.711 --> 12:36.172
Who are you?

12:36.756 --> 12:38.716
How did a child like you get in here?

12:43.053 --> 12:45.848
I don't quite understand either,

12:46.348 --> 12:49.685
but there are some things
more fearsome than death.

12:50.269 --> 12:53.272
And it's happening at this very prison.

12:53.355 --> 12:55.941
So please turn back. Go back to your cell!

12:56.567 --> 12:59.236
No. My mom must be here to see me.

12:59.320 --> 13:01.113
I want to see her.

13:01.197 --> 13:02.823
She must be missing me too.

13:02.907 --> 13:06.869
I need to let her know
that I'm doing well!

13:08.204 --> 13:09.705
Then take this.

13:10.498 --> 13:12.333
It should protect you.

13:13.876 --> 13:16.337
FE40536, all right.

13:16.420 --> 13:17.254
Enter!

13:19.465 --> 13:20.633
These are bones!

13:24.595 --> 13:26.806
Stop dawdling. Get in.

13:50.496 --> 13:54.708
Jolyne, did you receive the charm
I asked your mom to give you?

13:56.377 --> 13:57.878
Dad…

14:03.008 --> 14:05.010
STAND NAME: STAR PLATINUM
STAND MASTER: JOTARO KUJO

14:07.721 --> 14:10.724
Car and wallet theft. Assault.

14:10.808 --> 14:14.144
This must be some mistake!
My Jolyne would never…

14:14.228 --> 14:17.439
Since she's only 14,
she won't be charged this time.

14:18.023 --> 14:19.316
You're headed to Tokyo?

14:19.400 --> 14:22.361
This is your daughter we're talking about!

14:23.112 --> 14:26.407
Why not go tomorrow instead?
And you call yourself her father?

14:26.490 --> 14:28.826
Hello? Are you there?

14:43.424 --> 14:45.342
Jolyne, are you listening?

14:45.843 --> 14:46.677
Where's the pendant?

14:49.889 --> 14:52.600
I'd rather receive disciplinary action.

14:52.683 --> 14:54.977
Had I known it was you,
I wouldn't have come here.

14:55.561 --> 14:58.147
Hey, open the door!

14:58.230 --> 15:01.025
Shit, I hit him too hard.

15:01.108 --> 15:02.359
Get up!

15:02.943 --> 15:04.028
Good grief.

15:05.070 --> 15:06.405
Jolyne, listen up.

15:06.488 --> 15:08.324
It was not your boyfriend Romeo

15:08.407 --> 15:12.328
who conspired to frame you for murder
and had you sent to this prison.

15:13.829 --> 15:14.663
Johngalli A.

15:15.414 --> 15:18.208
This man is incarcerated
in the men's prison here.

15:18.792 --> 15:19.919
He's ex-military.

15:20.002 --> 15:24.006
A veteran sniper who could hit his mark
under any difficult circumstance.

15:24.089 --> 15:25.299
According to the report,

15:25.382 --> 15:28.677
his vision has deteriorated
due to cataracts.

15:29.345 --> 15:31.513
This man was behind it all.

15:31.597 --> 15:33.140
Even that manslaughter accident.

15:33.974 --> 15:37.645
A henchman of Johngalli A.
kidnapped an innocent hitchhiker

15:37.728 --> 15:39.605
and threw him in front of the car.

15:41.440 --> 15:43.400
He also hired a greedy lawyer

15:43.901 --> 15:45.611
to set up the trust-fund baby.

15:46.236 --> 15:49.073
Johngalli A. was pulling the strings
from this prison.

15:49.865 --> 15:51.492
Help me, Jolyne!

15:51.575 --> 15:53.744
Do you know what a "plea deal" is?

15:53.827 --> 15:55.162
I love you!

15:55.245 --> 15:57.539
This court finds the defendant,

15:57.623 --> 16:00.042
-Jolyne Cujoh…
-Fifteen years…

16:01.418 --> 16:05.089
Damn you! You hit me twice yesterday!

16:05.172 --> 16:06.924
Dammit!

16:08.676 --> 16:10.302
What's the point?

16:10.386 --> 16:15.265
Why would he plot my imprisonment?

16:16.934 --> 16:18.268
-Sit.
-Answer me!

16:18.352 --> 16:19.645
I said sit.

16:24.274 --> 16:27.194
Listen. Johngalli A.'s target
was you all along.

16:28.028 --> 16:30.656
It's so that he can eliminate you
any time he wishes

16:30.739 --> 16:32.074
within these prison walls.

16:32.157 --> 16:33.409
Why is he after me?

16:33.492 --> 16:36.245
Because you are my daughter.

16:36.829 --> 16:38.288
You are of the Joestar bloodline.

16:39.957 --> 16:40.958
Joestar?

16:41.834 --> 16:45.337
The Joestar bloodline
can be traced back hundreds of decades.

16:45.838 --> 16:48.549
And Johngalli A. plots to
take revenge on our family.

16:48.632 --> 16:52.553
We are endowed with
the wonderful gift to move others.

16:53.053 --> 16:55.055
But at times,
powerful emotions leave dregs.

16:55.556 --> 16:57.516
Dregs called grudges, that is.

16:58.726 --> 16:59.935
In the past,

17:00.019 --> 17:03.439
I defeated a mortal enemy
of the Joestar clan.

17:04.023 --> 17:06.525
Johngalli A. is a pawn of this enemy.

17:06.608 --> 17:08.861
We've never met,
but I have no doubt about it.

17:08.944 --> 17:11.363
Though it's been over 20 years,

17:11.447 --> 17:15.701
Johngalli A. uses his fanaticism
for this man to exact his revenge.

17:15.784 --> 17:19.246
I don't understand. I thought
you were just a marine biologist.

17:19.329 --> 17:21.415
What's this about enemies and grudges?

17:21.498 --> 17:24.418
Just know that you are being targeted.

17:25.002 --> 17:26.545
I'll get you out immediately.

17:26.628 --> 17:27.963
We will bypass the law.

17:28.047 --> 17:30.132
Have you acquired your Stand yet?

17:30.215 --> 17:31.383
"Stand"?

17:31.884 --> 17:35.512
As my daughter, you are predisposed
to the ability to use this power.

17:36.096 --> 17:38.849
Did you see any changes
from the pendant I gave you?

17:40.184 --> 17:41.852
It seems you have.

17:41.935 --> 17:43.312
That's the Stand ability.

17:43.896 --> 17:46.398
Stand… Then you too?

17:46.482 --> 17:47.816
Use your power to get out.

17:47.900 --> 17:48.859
Okay?

17:52.321 --> 17:53.447
Quit your yapping.

17:54.031 --> 17:55.783
Don't try to act like a father now.

17:58.744 --> 18:01.121
So you're finally here to save me.

18:01.205 --> 18:02.915
What, because you love me?

18:02.998 --> 18:06.126
I've already forgotten about you.

18:06.210 --> 18:07.836
But fine, whatever.

18:07.920 --> 18:11.215
I'll keep that shocking story
and the Stand ability in mind.

18:13.425 --> 18:14.802
You can go now.

18:14.885 --> 18:16.678
Don't ever visit me again.

18:19.515 --> 18:21.141
My handcuffs!

18:21.225 --> 18:22.601
When did I get out of them?

18:29.608 --> 18:30.859
Since when…

18:31.735 --> 18:33.070
The brand is different.

18:33.153 --> 18:36.615
The guard didn't even approach the table.

18:38.158 --> 18:40.077
Jolyne, get away from that door!

18:41.370 --> 18:43.997
Star Platinum: The World!

18:45.040 --> 18:46.291
Time, stop!

19:07.020 --> 19:08.856
What happened just now?

19:08.939 --> 19:11.316
Stay still! The fight has already begun.

19:16.280 --> 19:19.616
What's the layout to the right?
Any windows in that direction?

19:19.700 --> 19:23.495
Two or three. But they're all barred.

19:23.579 --> 19:25.038
This is a real bullet.

19:25.539 --> 19:28.584
This bullet, called a Sniper Premium,
is specific to rifles.

19:29.168 --> 19:31.420
The shot was undoubtedly
taken by Johngalli A.

19:31.503 --> 19:34.756
Hold on, I thought he was an inmate.

19:34.840 --> 19:37.342
Inmates are prohibited
from even having pens.

19:37.426 --> 19:40.053
Is that so?
But guns can be disassembled, you see.

19:40.637 --> 19:43.307
Precise parts may be snuck in
through various objects.

19:43.807 --> 19:46.560
Guards can be bribed by his henchmen

19:46.643 --> 19:48.729
and the objects won't get searched.

19:49.313 --> 19:51.565
Little by little, slowly but surely.

19:51.648 --> 19:56.153
But we're in the women's prison!
He can't possibly shoot me from the men's!

19:56.236 --> 19:59.239
We're inside a building.
There are obstructions!

19:59.323 --> 20:01.950
A rifle and an ability make that possible.

20:02.034 --> 20:05.204
In other words, Johngalli A. is,
without a doubt, a Stand user.

20:06.330 --> 20:07.164
Look.

20:16.882 --> 20:17.966
What's that?

20:20.677 --> 20:22.137
Keep your distance.

20:22.721 --> 20:25.140
Certainly, that's not just some rubbish.

20:25.224 --> 20:26.642
But it's moving away.

20:27.226 --> 20:28.393
It seems really light.

20:28.894 --> 20:30.771
It's just floating in the air.

20:30.854 --> 20:32.105
Don't engage it.

20:32.189 --> 20:34.900
First, we must know what it can do.

20:38.862 --> 20:39.738
It dodged!

20:39.821 --> 20:41.198
I said don't engage it.

20:41.281 --> 20:43.116
Can it see my thread?

20:43.200 --> 20:44.743
Don't be so loud.

20:44.826 --> 20:46.370
It's reacting to something.

20:47.079 --> 20:48.580
However, not to the thread.

20:49.289 --> 20:51.291
Its movement seems unrelated
to the thread.

20:52.417 --> 20:55.379
Oh, could it be reacting to that?

20:55.462 --> 20:58.548
What was it called?
The change in the air from the thread.

20:58.632 --> 21:00.634
Like, the movement of the air?

21:00.717 --> 21:03.303
Aerodynamics.

21:03.387 --> 21:05.597
It detected our positions
using aerodynamics.

21:05.681 --> 21:08.100
All right, so he knows our location.

21:08.183 --> 21:10.686
But how can he shoot us
from the men's dormitory?

21:10.769 --> 21:12.437
That's the real problem.

21:12.521 --> 21:16.525
Jolyne, you were saved
by a fortuitous accident.

21:17.109 --> 21:19.987
Do not make a move
until we understand the contraption.

21:20.570 --> 21:22.781
Don't order me around!

21:22.864 --> 21:28.203
-I know that!
-You… FE40536!

21:28.287 --> 21:32.040
You're done for, I'll have you know!

21:32.124 --> 21:34.835
Got it? Jolyne Cujoh!

21:37.379 --> 21:39.548
-What?
-It's headed towards us!

21:39.631 --> 21:42.634
I'll make sure you get disciplined!

21:42.718 --> 21:43.927
Don't move!

21:44.011 --> 21:47.639
After I beat you to death, that is!

21:47.723 --> 21:48.682
Calm down!

21:48.765 --> 21:50.684
Jolyne, don't leave the wall!

21:50.767 --> 21:52.728
I know! And don't order me!

21:52.811 --> 21:56.481
Let's knock him out
before we get into more trouble!

21:56.565 --> 21:59.151
Damn you, who do you think
you're talking to?

21:59.776 --> 22:01.320
You bastard!

22:01.403 --> 22:02.487
Jolyne!

23:41.378 --> 23:46.383
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
